          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What do the balloons in the model mentioned in Fig. 9.9 represent? What does the rubber sheet represent? In this model, the balloons represent the lungs, and the rubber sheet represents the diaphragm."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.185,
            0.386,
            0.206
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "SCIENCE AND SOCIETY"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.21,
            0.543,
            0.231
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Breathing Practices for a Healthy Life"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.234,
            0.789,
            0.289
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Breathing exercises have been practised across different cultures in India and worldwide for centuries. Pranayama is well known for improving respiratory health, mind relaxation, and concentration."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.291,
            0.317,
            0.402
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.132,
                0.291,
                0.317,
                0.402
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_10_image_4.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.324,
            0.288,
            0.788,
            0.414
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In Ladakh, people practise Tummo breathing, a technique that improves lung function and helps keep the body warm even in cold weather. Similarly, deep breathing techniques are used to promote well-being. Some traditions combine deep breathing with chanting, using rhythmic breath control to enhance relaxation and mental clarity."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.942,
            0.051,
            0.987,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "131"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.787,
            0.308,
            0.913,
            0.436
          ],
          "content": [
            {
