        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.46,
            0.372,
            0.48
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What do we breathe out?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.501,
            0.4,
            0.521
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 9.3: Let us explore"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.535,
            0.461,
            0.555
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "To be demonstrated by the teacher"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.557,
            0.473,
            0.632
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Take an equal amount of freshly prepared lime water in two test tubes, A and B, as given in Fig. 9.11."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.636,
            0.472,
            0.71
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In test tube A, pass the air using a syringe/pichkari (Fig. 9.11a). This is the same air that you inhale."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.714,
            0.472,
            0.791
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In test tube B, repeatedly blow air through your mouth into the lime water using a straw (Fig. 9.11b)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.488,
            0.537,
